{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"trig-quadrants-and-monotonicity-0.1.0","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"trig-quadrants-and-monotonicity","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"trig-quadrants-and-monotonicity-0.1.0-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"单位圆与正弦函数的单调性及象限循环","goals":["理解单位圆四个象限的角度范围与纵坐标变化","建立单位圆动点纵坐标与正弦曲线波峰波谷的对应关系","掌握正弦函数在 [0, 2π] 及全实数域上的单调区间公式"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["直观演示：通过单位圆动点与正弦曲线的动态联动直观建立单调性感知","分段推导：按象限分段观察高度变化，推导增减区间","归纳推广：从 [0, 2π] 周期扩展到全实数域的通项公式","交互巩固：通过旋转角度到指定象限加深理解"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":0,"min":0,"max":6.28,"label":"旋转角度 θ","unit":"rad","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.031400000000000004}}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-02-task-01","prompt":"拖动角度滑块至 3π/2 弧度（约 4.71），观察动点到达最低点时的纵坐标。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["将角度 θ 从 π/2 继续增大。","到达第三象限与第四象限交界处，即 θ = 4.71 rad。"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"很好！你已经观察到在 3π/2 处正弦函数取得最低点 -1。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider","geometry_point"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":4.71,"tolerance":0.015700000000000002}},{"as":"section-03-task-01","prompt":"拖动旋转角度 θ 到 2π，观察纵坐标如何回到起点 0。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["将角度滑块拖至最大值 2π (约 6.28)","注意动点的 y 坐标值变化"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"非常好！你成功观察到了第四象限单调递增及周期的完整轮回。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider","geometry_point"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":6.28,"tolerance":0.015700000000000002}},{"as":"section-04-task-01","prompt":"请拖动滑动条，将角度 θ 设置在第二象限单调递减区间 (π/2, π) 内，例如 2.09 rad (约 120°)。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["第二象限的角度范围在 π/2 (约 1.57) 到 π (约 3.14) 之间。","在第二象限，随着角度增加，纵坐标从 1 下降到 0，函数单调递减。"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"非常好！你成功将角度旋转到了第二象限的单调递减区间。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider","geometry_point"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":2.1038,"tolerance":0.015700000000000002}}]}}
